Error [E0421]: `uninit` needs a typed-literal head
  --> tests/ui/uninit_no_type.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     x := uninit
    |          ^^^^^^
 Why: an uninitialized binding has no value to infer its type from, so the type must head the literal
 Fix: write `x := <Type>.{ uninit }`, e.g. `buffer := [U8#4096].{ uninit }`
